{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DuneCrawl is an 1-4 player online+local coop action-adventure game where players take on the roles of desert faring privateers. Together, players explore the dust seas by piloting their Dune Crawler, a gigantic walking crustacean festooned with cannons and treasure maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through sprawling, lush, hand drawn environments to unfold the story surrounding the mystery of the Dune Crawlers. Interact with quest-giving NPCs, defend the local towns from bandits, discover hidden plunder, ride armored scarabs and defend your title as the greatest freebooter this side of the seven sands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1833200?t=1763579711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1833200?t=1763579711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833200/120c101c6cb331cd87281c5b50d4dab0a1f91b9f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763579711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833200/120c101c6cb331cd87281c5b50d4dab0a1f91b9f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763579711","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"d